<title>USA: Stryker to apply for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Stryker to apply for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stryker Corp said Monday the company has applied for listing its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange and expects its shares will begin trading under the symbol SYK.N in late July.</p>
<p>Stryker makes specialty surgical and medical products, patient care and handling equipment, and provides outpatient physical therapy services.</p>
